      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for the \"Getting Started\" guide, focusing on developer efficiency.\n\n**Authentication**\nBefore making any calls, you must authenticate with your API key, which should be securely included in the `Authorization` header of every request as a Bearer token. Obtain your key from your project dashboard and ensure you are using HTTPS for all communication to maintain security.\n\n**Your First Request**\nTo initiate your first connection, send a simple GET request to the `/status` endpoint. Replace `[YOUR_API_KEY]` in the authorization header and observe the JSON response to confirm successful connection and API availability.",
